@y2zyyr/dsh-restart-control README · Restart DSH：Adds a **Restart DSH** button to DSH Desktop → Settings → General (通用设置). It sits
directly below「繁忙时 Enter 键行为」and lets you restart the DSH Desktop application
with one click, using DSH's **official** graceful restart facility.

@y2zyyr/dsh-restart-control README · Installation：The plugin's own `cordis.patch.yml` registers the Loader entry; the host half is
loaded by Cordis and the browser half is served as
`/plugins/@y2zyyr/dsh-restart-control/client.js`.
